      "id": "clm_01M4VCA0BQK5HVWG07P2QK9HTV",
      "statement": "In 610–609 BC Egypt sent armies to support Assyria against Babylon, and in summer 609 an Egyptian army with Aššur-uballiṭ crossed the Euphrates against Harran.",
      "layer": "evidence",
      "passage": null,
      "classification": "independently_corroborated",
      "reasoning": "ABC 3 records the Egyptian army helping Aššur-uballiṭ in year 16 and crossing the Euphrates with him in Du'ûzu of year 17; Josephus, independently of the chronicle, says Necho marched to fight the Medes and Babylonians. Lumby's pre-1923 reading (\"against the king of Assyria\") is superseded on this point.",
      "supporting_evidence": [
        "evd_01M4VCA0BQ3X5T86S23BCBEH5B",
        "evd_01M4VCA0BQFJDEMP8CAJGV84CT"
